---
---

<section class="section" style="background: var(--dark-surface-01); color: #ffffff;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="badge-pill dark" style="background: rgba(77,255,176,0.15); border-color: var(--theme-color-01); color: var(--theme-color-01);">
        <span class="badge-dot"></span>
        <span>Sustainability & Governance</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="heading-2" style="color: #ffffff;">
        Responsible Energy Stewardship & Host Community Equity
      </h2>
      <p style="color: #b3b0b0; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 14px; max-width: 720px;">
        At Vrosk Energies, sustainable growth requires unyielding commitment to occupational safety, stringent environmental mitigation, and honest community partnerships.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Outgriid 3-Column Bento Cards -->
    <div class="bento-grid-3">
      <!-- Card 1: HSE -->
      <div class="bento-card-dark" style="justify-content: space-between;">
        <div>
          <div class="badge-pill dark" style="font-size: 0.725rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
            Safety First
          </div>
          <h3 class="heading-3" style="font-size: 1.35rem; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 12px;">
            Health, Safety & Environment (HSE)
          </h3>
          <p style="color: #a8a4a4; font-size: 0.925rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            Ensuring that our workers, contractors, stakeholders, and immediate operating communities return home safely every single day.
          </p>
          <ul style="list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 0.8125rem; color: #d0cccc;">
            <li>✓ Zero-incident Target across all cargo discharges</li>
            <li>✓ OCIMF Marine safety guidelines for STS transfers</li>
            <li>✓ Rigorous personal protective equipment (PPE) compliance</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); margin-top: 24px;">
          <a href="/health-safety-environment" style="color: var(--theme-color-01); font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
            HSE Protocols & Manual →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: CSR -->
      <div class="bento-card-dark" style="justify-content: space-between;">
        <div>
          <div class="badge-pill dark" style="font-size: 0.725rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
            Community Equity
          </div>
          <h3 class="heading-3" style="font-size: 1.35rem; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 12px;">
            Community Relations & CSR
          </h3>
          <p style="color: #a8a4a4; font-size: 0.925rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            Treating host communities with dignity, honesty, and proactive investment. We build long-term social licenses to operate through tangible socioeconomic uplift.
          </p>
          <ul style="list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 0.8125rem; color: #d0cccc;">
            <li>✓ Priority local content employment and subcontracting</li>
            <li>✓ Youth vocational training and technical scholarships</li>
            <li>✓ Proactive dialogue with traditional councils and youth leaders</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); margin-top: 24px;">
          <a href="/community-relations-csr" style="color: var(--theme-color-01); font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
            Community Engagement Policy →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Environmental Risks -->
      <div class="bento-card-dark" style="justify-content: space-between;">
        <div>
          <div class="badge-pill dark" style="font-size: 0.725rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
            Climate & Ecology
          </div>
          <h3 class="heading-3" style="font-size: 1.35rem; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 12px;">
            Environmental Risk Governance
          </h3>
          <p style="color: #a8a4a4; font-size: 0.925rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            Deploying active spill response protocols, vapor recovery units (VRU), and promoting transition fuels (LPG and CNG) to curb regional carbon emissions.
          </p>
          <ul style="list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 0.8125rem; color: #d0cccc;">
            <li>✓ Tier-1 oil spill containment gear on all maritime vessels</li>
            <li>✓ Promoting cleaner LPG to displace dirty firewood & kerosene</li>
            <li>✓ Continuous emissions tracking and water quality testing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div style="padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); margin-top: 24px;">
          <a href="/environmental-risks" style="color: var(--theme-color-01); font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
            Environmental Risk Framework →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
